  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop brown onion.\n• Finely chop or crush garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e1bc971405a9ee1f378b/step-e22fc600.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook onion and mushrooms until softened, 5-6 mins.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add pesto-flavoured powder, the water, risotto rice and the stock powder. Bring to the boil, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e1bc971405a9ee1f378b/step-aa8a2210.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer risotto to a baking dish.\n• Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e1bc971405a9ee1f378b/step-34b78420.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir Parmesan cheese, the butter and baby spinach through risotto.\n• Add a splash of water to loosen risotto, if needed. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• Divide risotto between bowls. Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e1bc971405a9ee1f378b/step-62b07430.jpg"
    }
  ]
